      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    december_quantities = [120, 50]\n    november_prices = [0.90, 0.60]\n    december_prices = [1.00, 0.80]\n\n    # Calculate the Paasche price index using December quantities\n    december_basket_cost = sum(\n        quantity * price\n        for quantity, price in zip(december_quantities, december_prices)\n    )\n    base_price_basket_cost = sum(\n        quantity * price\n        for quantity, price in zip(december_quantities, november_prices)\n    )\n    paasche_index = (december_basket_cost / base_price_basket_cost) * 100\n\n    # return answer to three decimal places\n    return round(paasche_index, 3)\n```",
